# Local scratch, clones, logs, and tool-managed config (not project source)
# Agent-tool files: track only taste/ (reviewed, shared preferences); everything
# else under .commandcode/ is machine-specific (see the agent-protocol standard).
# .agent/ is local scratch, except the episodic canon, which is tracked
/.agent/*
!/.agent/episodes.md
/.commandcode/*
!/.commandcode/taste/
!/.commandcode/taste/**

# Agent/user scratch and run artifacts
/scratchpad/
/test-output.txt
vitest.config.ts.timestamp-*
